{% comment %}
    LOCATION — the Location page (route `about/location`, InnerDefault, the page
    header as set in Page Properties).

    Block:                    an HTML block in the Main zone
    Block content:            {% include '~~/Assets/Lava/Location.lava' %}
    Enabled Lava Commands:    RockEntity  (the student-night events)

    Content from www.vrl.church/about/locations, tightened for a first-time
    guest. Barker is the one campus (Riverside was already hidden on the old
    page). Service times match the footer (Footer.lava, PageNav.lava); the
    online times match the live page's stream (Sundays only). Student nights
    from their event pages: Middle School Wednesdays 6:30–8pm (/events/618),
    High School Sundays 6–8pm (/events/617). The old page's MIDWEEK is retired.

    Sections (the title and intro line are the page header's, from Page
    Properties, so the content starts with the visit card):
      Visit          the Barker campus card (map, address, times, directions)
                      beside a quiet "Can't make it?" aside (watching online is
                      a convenience, not its own community: stream times and
                      where to watch, as row links)
      What to expect  photo + text (photo placeholder for now)
      For your family Kids and Students tiles

    Styles: Styles/_content.scss (content-columns, content-place,
    content-aside, row-link, content-split, content-tiles, content-times).
    ROCK: the address and times are hardcoded here and in the footer/nav; pull
    them from the campus and its schedules when those are set up. The student
    nights come from their events (studentEvents, below).
{% endcomment %}
{%- assign mapsQuery = '1831+S+Barker+Rd,+Spokane+Valley,+WA+99016' -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Student nights in the Students tile: event occurrence id ^ the label above
  its name, in order. Each row is the event's photo, name and next date
  (from Rock), linked to /events/{id}. An inactive or missing one is skipped.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign studentEvents = '618^Middle school|617^High school' -%}
{%- assign fallbackImageGuid = 'ea573748-2354-4f4a-875d-b8d2dfa30e5d' -%}
{%- assign chevron = '<svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chevron-right"/></svg>' -%}

<article class="content-page location" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Article">
  <meta itemprop="headline" content="Location">
  <div class="content-toc-scope" itemprop="articleBody">

  <div class="content-columns">

    <section class="content-place" aria-labelledby="loc-barker">
      <iframe class="content-place__map" src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=Valley+Real+Life,+{{ mapsQuery }}&amp;z=14&amp;output=embed" title="Map to Valley Real Life, 1831 S. Barker Rd, Spokane Valley" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe>
      <div class="content-place__body">
        <p class="content-kicker">In person</p>
        <h2 id="loc-barker">Barker Campus</h2>
        <address class="content-place__address">1831 S. Barker Rd, Spokane Valley, WA 99016</address>
        <p>Off South Barker Road in Spokane Valley, on 44 acres in the Saltese Flats next to the wetlands.</p>
        <dl class="content-times">
          <div><dt>Thursday</dt><dd>6:30pm</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Sunday</dt><dd>8:00, 9:30, 11:00am &amp; 12:30pm</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <div class="content-place__actions">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="https://maps.google.com/?q={{ mapsQuery }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get directions</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <aside class="content-aside" aria-labelledby="loc-online">
      <h2 id="loc-online">Can't make it?</h2>
      <p>Sunday services stream live at 8:00, 9:30 and 11:00am, and every message is online afterward.</p>
      <nav class="content-aside__links" aria-label="Watch online">
        <a class="row-link" href="/watch/live"><span class="row-link__icon"><svg width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-play"/></svg></span><span class="row-link__label">Watch live</span><span class="row-link__chev">{{ chevron }}</span></a>
        <a class="row-link" href="/watch/previous-messages"><span class="row-link__icon"><svg width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-microphone"/></svg></span><span class="row-link__label">Previous messages</span><span class="row-link__chev">{{ chevron }}</span></a>
        <a class="row-link" href="https://www.youtube.com/c/ValleyRealLife" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="row-link__icon"><svg width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-youtube"/></svg></span><span class="row-link__label">YouTube</span><span class="row-link__chev">{{ chevron }}</span></a>
        <a class="row-link" href="https://www.facebook.com/valleyreallife" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="row-link__icon"><svg width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-facebook"/></svg></span><span class="row-link__label">Facebook</span><span class="row-link__chev">{{ chevron }}</span></a>
      </nav>
    </aside>

  </div>

  <section class="content-split content-split--reverse" aria-labelledby="loc-expect">
    <div class="content-split__text">
      <h2 id="loc-expect">What to expect</h2>
      <p>You'll be greeted by smiling faces from all walks of life. Wear your Sunday best or jeans and a hoodie, whatever's comfortable. We'll spend about an hour together in a mix of music and a biblically-centered message.</p>
      <p>First time here? Park up front (we have a spot just for you) and stop by the Connecting Point in the lobby. We have a gift for you.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content-split__media">
      <figure class="content-photo content-photo--placeholder"><span>Photo: greeters at the front doors</span></figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="sermons-divider" id="family"><h2>For your family</h2></div>

  <ul class="content-tiles" aria-label="Kids and students">
    <li class="content-tile">
      <span class="content-tile__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg></span>
      <h3>Kids</h3>
      <p class="content-kicker">Birth–5th grade</p>
      <p>Kids love their time at VRL, and we know yours will too. We have classes for birth through 5th grade during every service, with secure check-in and check-out and fully screened staff and volunteers.</p>
      <p>First time? Stop by the New Family kiosk and we'll show you around and help you check in.</p>
      {%- comment -%} ROCK: Family Pre-Registration lives on the current site; point at the new site's page when it has one {%- endcomment %}
      <p><a class="btn btn--primary" href="https://www.vrl.church/familypreregistration">Pre-register your kids</a></p>
      <div class="content-tile__actions">
        <a class="text-cta" href="/ministries/kids">Explore VRL Kids <svg width="14" height="14" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-right"/></svg></a>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="content-tile">
      <span class="content-tile__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22"><use href="#i-users"/></svg></span>
      <h3>Students</h3>
      <p class="content-kicker">6th–12th grade</p>
      <p>Students are welcome in our worship services with their families. They also have nights just for them: a fun, safe place to bring friends, learn about Jesus and do life together.</p>
      {%- comment -%} Student nights: the events themselves (photo, name, next date) {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- capture studentEventsHtml -%}
      {%- assign studentEventList = studentEvents | Split:'|' -%}
      {%- for entry in studentEventList -%}
        {%- assign entryParts = entry | Split:'^' -%}
        {%- assign occId = entryParts[0] | AsInteger -%}
        {%- assign occLabel = entryParts[1] -%}
        {%- eventitemoccurrence id:'{{ occId }}' securityenabled:'false' -%}
          {%- if eventitemoccurrence and eventitemoccurrence.EventItem.IsActive -%}
          {%- assign ev = eventitemoccurrence.EventItem -%}
          {%- assign evPhotoGuid = ev.Photo.Guid | Default:fallbackImageGuid -%}
          <li class="content-event" data-card>
            <img class="content-event__thumb" src="/GetImage.ashx?guid={{ evPhotoGuid }}&amp;w=320&amp;h=180&amp;mode=crop" alt="" loading="lazy">
            <div class="content-event__body">
              <p class="content-event__label">{{ occLabel }}</p>
              <h4 class="content-event__title"><a href="/events/{{ occId }}" data-card-link>{{ ev.Name }}</a></h4>
              {%- if eventitemoccurrence.NextStartDateTime %}
              <p class="content-event__meta"><svg width="14" height="14" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-clock"/></svg> Next: {{ eventitemoccurrence.NextStartDateTime | Date:'ddd, MMM d · h:mm tt' }}</p>
              {%- endif %}
            </div>
            <span class="content-event__chev" aria-hidden="true">{{ chevron }}</span>
          </li>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endeventitemoccurrence -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
      {%- endcapture -%}
      {%- assign studentEventsHtml = studentEventsHtml | Trim -%}
      {%- if studentEventsHtml != '' %}
      <ul class="content-events" aria-label="Student nights">
        {{ studentEventsHtml }}
      </ul>
      {%- endif %}
      <div class="content-tile__actions">
        <a class="text-cta" href="/ministries/students">Explore VRL Students <svg width="14" height="14" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-right"/></svg></a>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ul>

  </div>
</article>
